NEARS-2700 — ModuleCheckMiddleware except-list invalid-moduleId demonstration (live, 8124)

Excepted route (api/v1/banners, matches the `except` array literally):
  no moduleId header    -> 200
  moduleId: 999999 (invalid, unresolvable) -> 200  <- the fix under test
  moduleId: 1 (valid)    -> 200

Non-excepted control route (api/v1/coupon/list/all -- does NOT match the
literal 'api/v1/coupon/list' except pattern, confirmed no wildcard):
  no moduleId header      -> 403 {"code":"moduleId","message":"Module id required"}
  moduleId: 999999 (invalid) -> 403 {"code":"moduleId","message":"Not found"}
  moduleId: 1 (valid)      -> 200
